# Valliani Mail

**Not Gmail.** `/email` = Google. `/valliani-mail` = `@valliani.app` IMAP mailbox via teammate API.

## Layout

- Route: `/valliani-mail` · nav label “Valliani Mails”
- Permission: same app key `"email"` as Gmail
- UI: folders | list | reading pane + compose modal
- Core dirs: `src/lib/valliani-mail/`, `src/components/valliani-mail/`, `src/app/(app)/valliani-mail/`, `src/app/api/valliani-mail/`

## API

- Browser calls `/api/valliani-mail/*` only
- Proxy forwards to `MAIL_API_BASE_URL` (default `https://mail-api.valliani.app/api`)
- Headers: `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` + `x-mail-token: <mailToken>`
- Session in localStorage (`mail_access_token`, `mail_mail_token`, login email/password for refresh)

## Message model

- IMAP **uid** + folder path (not Gmail thread id)
- Type `MailMessage`: from/to/cc/bcc (`MailAddress`), subject, date, flags, preview, bodyText/bodyHtml, attachments, messageId, inReplyTo, references
- List page: `MailMessagePage` (messages, total, offset, limit, hasMore)
- Synthetic folders: `__all__` (All Mail), `__starred__` (Favorites)

## Client API (`src/lib/valliani-mail/api.ts`)

login / me / refreshMailToken · folders · summary · getMessagePage · getMessage · contacts · **sendMail** · saveDraft · flags · move · archive · spam · delete · forward

Send body: to/cc/bcc comma strings, text/html, optional reply threading (`inReplyTo`, `references`, `replyToUid`, `replyToFolder`), attachments `{ filename, base64, contentType }`

## Wiring status (keep in mind)

Works in UI: login, list, read, send, reply/forward-via-send, star/seen, archive, spam, trash · attachment preview/download · compose/reply attach · inline reply · thread list collapse · rich compose toolbar · AI Draft (same rules as Gmail Email) · thread view (API thread or All-Mail subject match; reply stays in thread)  
Incomplete vs API: saveDraft unused · server forward unused · move unused · scheduled/snoozed folders not in sidebar

## AI draft + send guards (parity with `/email`)

Reuse Gmail helpers — do **not** invent a second rule set:

- `bodyMentionsAttachment()` from `src/lib/email-utils.ts` (run on **plain** body via `htmlToPlain`)
- AI Draft / polish / rewrite via `POST /api/email/draft` with IMAP thread mapped by `mailThreadToDraftEmail()` (`src/lib/valliani-mail/ai-draft.ts`) — pass `email` stub; do not call Gmail fetch/send
- **Block send** when: missing subject · body mentions attachment but none attached · no recipients · empty body and no attachments
- New mail / forward: AI Draft requires a rough body first (“make professional”)
- Reply / reply-all: auto AI Draft on open; Regen + Shorter / Formal / Casual

## Rules when changing

- Do not wire Valliani Mail through Google Gmail helpers (except shared draft LLM + `bodyMentionsAttachment`)
- Prefer extending `src/lib/valliani-mail/api.ts` + types before new proxy routes
- Sanitize HTML with existing `sanitizeEmailHtmlForPreview`
- Self-check: `npx tsx scripts/check-valliani-mail-api.ts`
